{
  "_note": "热度地图(map 卡):首页前 30 条的上榜时长 × 得分,圆径 = 评论数。生成器 gen_hacker.py。",
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "action": "request",
      "id": "resp",
      "params": {
        "url": "https://hn.algolia.com/api/v1/search?tags=front_page&hitsPerPage=30&attributesToRetrieve=title,points,num_comments,created_at_i,objectID&attributesToHighlight=none",
        "method": "GET",
        "formatType": "json"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_b",
        "value": "1"
      },
      "_note": "⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${resp.hits}),0),0,1)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "action": "error",
          "params": {
            "errorMsg": "hn_unreachable"
          }
        }
      ],
      "_note": "取数失败 → 抛错终止流,平台据此回落上次成功数据(G26/§7.2)"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nowS",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(${@time.nowMs}/1000),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "at",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(${@time.nowMs},HH:mm)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "n",
        "value": "$[length::(${resp.hits})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "pmax",
        "value": "$[max::(max::(pluck::(${resp.hits},points)),1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cmax",
        "value": "$[max::(max::(pluck::(${resp.hits},num_comments)),1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "h0",
        "value": "$[max::(calc::((${nowS}-${resp.hits[0].created_at_i})/3600),1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "v0",
        "value": "$[if::(lt::(0,${n}),calc::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.hits[0].points},0)/${h0}),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "hc0",
        "value": "$[min::(${h0},48.0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "x0",
        "value": "$[if::(lt::(0,${n}),parseNumber::(calc::(6+270.0*${hc0}*60.0/(48.0*(${hc0}+12.0))),0.0),-99)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "q0",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp.hits[0].points},0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "y0",
        "value": "$[if::(lt::(0,${n}),parseNumber::(calc::(172.0-164.0*${q0}*1.25*${pmax}/(${pmax}*(${q0}+${pmax}/4))),0.0),-99)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "k0",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp.hits[0].num_comments},0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "s0",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(5+11*${k0}*1.25/(${k0}+${cmax}/4)),0.0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "h1",
        "value": "$[max::(calc::((${nowS}-${resp.hits[1].created_at_i})/3600),1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
